
# Cached model replies (LLM_CACHE_DIR, local dev only). NEVER committed: the key is derived
# from the question and the value is clinical text, so a cache in git history is a copy of
# both that redact_query (#28) can never reach — the exact thing erasure exists to prevent.
.cache/

# Eval runs are results, and results are worth keeping — but they carry the questions asked.
# The set in eval/questions.yaml is fictional and public; keep runs of it, and if a run ever
# uses real clinical questions it does not belong in git.
!eval/runs/
